6:["$","main",null,{"className":"min-h-screen py-20 px-4","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-2xl mx-auto","children":[["$","$L5",null,{"href":"/blog","className":"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-300 transition-colors mb-8","children":"← Volver al blog"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-8","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-3 mb-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-xs font-semibold px-2 py-1 rounded-lg text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-400/10","children":"Laboral"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-slate-600 text-xs","children":["6 min"," lectura"]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-slate-600 text-xs","children":"·"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-slate-600 text-xs","children":"4 de mayo de 2026"}]]}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"text-3xl font-bold text-white leading-tight mb-4","children":"Cómo calcular el sueldo líquido en Chile paso a paso"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-slate-400 text-lg","children":"Descuento AFP, salud, IUSC... aprende qué se descuenta del sueldo bruto para obtener el sueldo líquido en Chile con ejemplos prácticos."}]]}],["$","$Le",null,{"id":"5678901234","className":"mb-8"}],["$","article",null,{"className":"prose prose-invert prose-slate max-w-none","children":[[["$","h2","0",{"className":"text-xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-4","children":"¿Qué es el sueldo líquido?"}],["$","p","1",{"className":"text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"El <strong class=\"text-white\">sueldo líquido</strong> (o sueldo neto) es el monto que efectivamente recibes después de todos los descuentos legales. El sueldo bruto es el pactado en el contrato; el líquido es lo que entra a tu cuenta."}}],["$","p","2",{"className":"text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"En Chile, los descuentos obligatorios son:"}}],["$","p","3",{"className":"text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"1. AFP (cotización previsional)"}}],["$","p","4",{"className":"text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"2. Salud (ISAPRE o FONASA)"}}],["$","p","5",{"className":"text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"3. SIS (Seguro de Invalidez y Sobrevivencia) — lo paga el empleador"}}],["$","p","6",{"className":"text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"4. IUSC (Impuesto Único de Segunda Categoría) — solo si superas cierto monto"}}],["$","h2","7",{"className":"text-xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-4","children":"Paso 1: Cotización AFP"}],["$","p","8",{"className":"text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"La cotización obligatoria de AFP es el <strong class=\"text-white\">10% del sueldo imponible</strong> (con tope de 81,6 UF ~ $3.182.400). Adicionalmente, cada AFP cobra una <strong class=\"text-white\">comisión</strong> que varía entre 0,49% y 1,45%."}}],["$","p","9",{"className":"text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<strong class=\"text-white\">Ejemplo:</strong> Sueldo $900.000"}}],["$","li","10",{"className":"text-slate-300 ml-4 mb-1 list-disc","children":"AFP 10%: $90.000"}],["$","li","11",{"className":"text-slate-300 ml-4 mb-1 list-disc","children":"Comisión AFP Habitat (0,69%): $6.210"}],["$","li","12",{"className":"text-slate-300 ml-4 mb-1 list-disc","children":"**Total AFP: $96.210**"}],["$","h2","13",{"className":"text-xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-4","children":"Paso 2: Cotización de salud"}],["$","p","14",{"className":"text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"Si estás en <strong class=\"text-white\">FONASA</strong>, descuentas el 7% del sueldo imponible (tope 81,6 UF)."}}],["$","p","15",{"className":"text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"Si estás en <strong class=\"text-white\">ISAPRE</strong>, el descuento mínimo legal es también 7%, pero el plan contratado puede ser mayor."}}],["$","p","16",{"className":"text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<strong class=\"text-white\">Ejemplo:</strong> $900.000 × 7% = $63.000"}}],["$","h2","17",{"className":"text-xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-4","children":"Paso 3: Base para el IUSC"}],["$","p","18",{"className":"text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"Una vez descontados AFP y salud, tienes la <strong class=\"text-white\">base imponible para el IUSC</strong>:"}}],["$","p","19",{"className":"text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"Base IUSC = Sueldo bruto - AFP (10%) - Salud (7%)"}}],["$","p","20",{"className":"text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<strong class=\"text-white\">Ejemplo:</strong> $900.000 - $90.000 - $63.000 = $747.000"}}],["$","h2","21",{"className":"text-xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-4","children":"Paso 4: Impuesto Único de Segunda Categoría (IUSC)"}],["$","p","22",{"className":"text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"El IUSC es un impuesto progresivo sobre la renta mensual que se descuenta en la fuente. Los tramos para 2026 son (aprox.):"}}],null,["$","p","24",{"className":"text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"|---|---|"}}],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["$","p","32",{"className":"text-slate-500 text-sm italic mt-6 border-t border-white/[0.06] pt-4","children":"(Valores referenciales 2026. Consultar SII para valores exactos.)"}],["$","p","33",{"className":"text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"Con base imponible de $747.000, estás en el tramo exento → IUSC = $0."}}],["$","h2","34",{"className":"text-xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-4","children":"Paso 5: Calcular el sueldo líquido"}],["$","p","35",{"className":"text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html